# kukansite/settings_prod.py — removed in stage 4; secrets now live in
# /etc/kukan/kukan.env (prod) and .env (dev), neither of which is committed.
.env
logs/
# Anchored: an unanchored `static/` also matches kukan/static/, the app's
# static *source* directory, and silently swallows anything new added under
# it (found the hard way — this is the same class of bug that ate
# scrub_local_db.py via an unanchored `*db*`). Only STATIC_ROOT, the
# collectstatic *output* directory at the repo root, should be ignored.
/static/
**/__pycache__/
*sqlite*
venv/
.venv/
.coverage
htmlcov/
